---

<ProjectPageLayout
    pageTitle={pageTitle}
    projectName={projectName}
    year={year}
    client={client}
    notableContributions={notableContributions}
    projectImages={images}
    headerImage={rpf_08}
>
    <p>
        Red Planet Farming is a casual, single-player strategy game for desktop
        made in Unity (C#). The game received the NYU & Alfred P. Sloan
        Foundation Games Production Grant in 2019 and released on Steam in May
        2020. The game currently has over 60,000 downloads and an overwhelmingly
        positive reccomendation rating.
        <br /><br />
        Red Planet Farming was a part of the MAGFest Indie Video Game Showcase (MIVS)
        in 2020. A demo of the game was also released on CoolMathGames in early 2020.
        <br /><br />
        I was the sole designer and developer on Red Planet Farming. My team also
        consisted of artist Sean Park and sound designer Sean Porio.
    </p>
</ProjectPageLayout>
